  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is the positive root of the equation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
